# Reserved for future Cygwin/Windows-only dotfiles.
#
# The cygwin/ snippet directory at the repo root is still sourced via the
# .bashrc loop (and zprofile loop) and is NOT stowed. This package exists so
# that `stow windows-cygwin` is a valid target once Cygwin-specific dotfiles
# (files that should be symlinked into $HOME) are added. Until then it
# contains only this placeholder.
